codex
One important point from the trace: expired cached markets are dropped before hydration and strategy scanning, so a stale fallback should not be directly tradeable if `end_date` parsed correctly. I’m checking the slug timestamp generation next because bucket alignment only works if the fetched slug set aligns to the same UTC window grid.
