   327	) -> Optional[datetime]:
   328	    """Parse the individual up/down candle end time from Gamma text.
   329	
   330	    Gamma event markets can expose an event-level ``endDate``. For hourly grouped
   331	    up/down events that is too late for 5m/15m entries, so prefer the market's
   332	    own time range when present.
   333	    """
