Another thing I’m checking because it matters for “prices are not cached”: the list cache stores `Market` objects, not immutable slugs. If price hydration mutates those objects and does not clear stale `price_hydrated` on misses, stale prices could leak through even though the list cache was intended to cache only slugs.
